<title>UK: Gehe plan new bid for Lloyds Chemists-paper.</title>
<headline>Gehe plan new bid for Lloyds Chemists-paper.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>German pharmaceutical wholesaler Gehe AG is likely to make a renewed offer for UK group Lloyds Chemists Plc before a UK takeover panel deadline runs out on Friday, said the Independent on Sunday newspaper.</p>
<p>The report said that Gehe sources had indicated it was likely to make a new offer. It submitted a 650 million sterling cash offer for the group earlier this year.</p>
<p>Gehe has been locked in a takeover battle with UK group UniChem, which is offering 657.6 million stg in cash and shares and already owns 9.9 percent of Lloyds.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
